# Terminology dataset URLs for `make fetch-corpus-sources` (sprint 21).
# Format: <dataset-name> <url>   — one per line, '#' comments.
#
# OPERATOR STEP: fill in the current dataset URLs before the first fetch.
# data.gov.ua resource URLs carry revision ids that change per publication,
# so they are deliberately not hardcoded here — pick the latest from:
#   drlz       https://data.gov.ua/dataset/…  (Державний реєстр лікарських засобів, ;-separated Windows-1251 CSV)
#   formulary  МОЗ Державний формуляр publication page
#   nk025      НК 025 classifier publication (normalise to one term per line before import)
#
# The pull is recorded in sources.lock (committed); the downloaded data
# lands in sources/ (gitignored). Licence register: docs/sprint-21/EXPLORE.md §2.
#
# drlz https://data.gov.ua/dataset/REPLACE-ME/resource/REPLACE-ME/download/drlz.csv
